  "A2A was open-sourced by Google in April 2025 with about 50 partners and donated to the Linux Foundation in June 2025.": 1,
  "As of May 2026 the current MCP spec version is 2025-06-18 and A2A is at 0.3.x, with a 1.0 A2A spec stabilization underway.": 1,
  "Future AGI names prompt injection through tool outputs (MCP) and impersonation through forged Agent Cards (A2A) as the top production risks.": 1,
  "Future AGI recommends routing every MCP and A2A call through a single gateway (its Agent Command Center) that provides allowlists, OAuth, guardrails and tracing.": 1,
  "OpenAI added MCP support to the Agents SDK in March 2025, Google announced MCP support for Gemini models in April 2025, and Microsoft shipped MCP in Windows Copilot, Visual Studio Code and the Azure AI stack across 2025.": 1
